    "models_comment": "The game's ship set (scripts/fetch-weights.mts at the pinned commit), each file pinned to a Hugging Face commit. Since 2026-11-23 (game e897c87) the NPC + Director model is Qwen3.5-2B (Apache-2.0; it replaced LFM3, whose licence has a revenue cap): the GGUF from unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF, the tokenizer, tokenizer_config and LICENSE from the base repo Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B (the GGUF repo ships none), placed in the GGUF repo's folder where the game looks. tokenizer_config.json and LICENSE are not LFS: their sha256 were taken from files whose git blob ids matched the tree API. The other 11 are unchanged from the previous pin.",
